# ncdu 2.x: one command-line option per line, argument space-separated ON
# the line; full-line `#` comments. No quotes — a quoted value reaches
# ncdu verbatim, and any malformed line is FATAL: exit 1 before the UI
# opens. Measured against ncdu 2.9.2 — see docs/traps.md.

# ncdu ships colourless (--color off is its default). dark renders the
# usage bars and selection in curses base pairs — the terminal palette,
# per the rider rule in docs/preferences.md § Colour.
--color dark
